SimulationType                MonteCarlo
NumberOfCycles                1000
NumberOfInitializationCycles  500
PrintEvery                    100

Forcefield                    local
ChargeMethod                  Ewald
EwaldPrecision                1e-6
CutOffVDW                      12.8
CutOffCoulomb                  12.8
RemoveAtomNumberCodeFromLabel yes

ComputeHenryCoefficients      yes
ComputeEnergyHistogram        yes
ComputeNumberOfMoleculesHistogram yes

Framework 0
FrameworkName framework
UnitCells 2 2 1
HeliumVoidFraction 0.7
ExternalTemperature 298.0
ExternalPressure 1e3

Component 0
            MoleculeName           nitrogen
            MoleculeDefinition     local
            TranslationProbability 1.0
            RotationProbability    1.0
            InsertionProbability   1.0
            DeletionProbability    1.0
            CreateNumberOfMolecules 0

